---
import ContentPage from '../components/ContentPage.astro';
import { APP_NAME, PRIVACY_EMAIL, SUPPORT_EMAIL } from '../data/site';
import { sitePath } from '../utils/paths';
---
<ContentPage
  pageTitle={`Support · ${APP_NAME}`}
  description={`Get help with ${APP_NAME}: contact, FAQ, restoring purchases, cancelling and deleting your data.`}
  eyebrow="Help"
  heading="Support"
>
  <h2>Contact us</h2>
  <p>
    Email <a href={`mailto:${SUPPORT_EMAIL}`}>{SUPPORT_EMAIL}</a>, or use "Report an issue" in the app's Settings.
    To help us find your data, include your user ID: in Settings, tap the version number and the app copies it to
    your clipboard.
  </p>

  <h2 id="faq">FAQ</h2>
  <h3>How do I trace a golf ball?</h3>
  <p>
    Start a new project, pick your video, scroll the timeline to the frame where the ball starts moving and select the
    ball. Automatic tracking follows it in a few seconds. Adjust the landing point and the arc if needed, then tap Preview.
  </p>
  <h3>Automatic tracking missed the ball. What now?</h3>
  <p>Trace it by hand: see <a href={sitePath('/manual-tracing')}>manual tracing</a>.</p>
  <h3>Does it work for disc golf?</h3>
  <p>Yes. Use the free curve mode and mark a few key points along the flight of the disc.</p>
  <h3>How should I film?</h3>
  <p>
    Film from behind the player in good light, start just before the swing or throw and stop a few seconds after the
    landing. Portrait or landscape both work, and a hand-held phone is fine.
  </p>
  <h3>Do I need an account?</h3>
  <p>No. The app creates an anonymous account for you; there is nothing to sign in to.</p>

  <h2 id="restore">Restore purchases</h2>
  <ol>
    <li>Make sure you are signed in with the Apple ID you used to subscribe.</li>
    <li>Open the app's Settings.</li>
    <li>Tap "Restore purchases".</li>
  </ol>

  <h2 id="cancel">Cancel a subscription</h2>
  <p>Subscriptions are managed by Apple, in your Apple ID settings:</p>
  <ol>
    <li>Open the Settings app on your iPhone.</li>
    <li>Tap your name, then Subscriptions.</li>
    <li>Tap SundayStroke Tracer, then Cancel Subscription.</li>
  </ol>
  <p>Cancel at least 24 hours before the current period ends to avoid the next renewal. Deleting the app does not cancel a subscription.</p>

  <h2 id="delete-data">Delete your data</h2>
  <ol>
    <li>In the app, open Settings, tap the version number to copy your user ID, and keep it.</li>
    <li>Tap "Delete account" and confirm. This deletes your account, your projects on this device and the clips uploaded to improve tracking.</li>
    <li>
      To delete the data the app can't delete itself (analytics, subscription profile, feedback), email
      <a href={`mailto:${PRIVACY_EMAIL}`}>{PRIVACY_EMAIL}</a> with your user ID. We reply within 30 days.
    </li>
  </ol>
  <p>Details are in the <a href={sitePath('/privacy')}>Privacy Policy</a>.</p>
</ContentPage>
